    'Mygo企鹅研究中心': 'Mygo Penguin Research Center',
    '程诺是一款需要联网使用的、基于 HarmonyOS 的 AI 日程应用，核心理念是"说到做到，一诺千金"——把每个承诺变成可见、可提醒、可回味的卡片。':
      'ChengNuo is an online, HarmonyOS-based AI scheduling app with one core belief: "say it and do it — a promise is precious." Every commitment becomes a card that is visible, reminder-ready and memorable.',
    '你可以把它当成一个会聊天的日程助手。把作业、考试、社团、实习和临时安排告诉 AI，它就能帮你生成日程卡片，还可以整理进卡片组。到点后，程诺会通过应用内弹窗、系统通知和邮件提醒你。完成后，卡片以碎卡动画收起，AI 自动生成一张明信片作为回忆，并汇总到周报里，帮你回顾完成率、延时情况。如果时间有变，还可以调整日程时间。':
      'Think of it as a schedule assistant you can chat with: tell the AI about homework, exams, clubs, internships or last-minute plans, and it turns them into schedule cards you can organize into card groups. When the time comes, ChengNuo reminds you via in-app popups, system notifications and email. Once done, the card folds away with a shred animation while the AI generates a postcard as a keepsake, and everything rolls into a weekly report of your completion rate and extensions. If plans change, simply adjust the schedule time.',
    '日程之外还有更多伙伴功能：养一只小企鹅陪你打卡，用积分在装饰商城为它换装；在发现页逛 AI 推荐的小铺卡片，一键加入日程；用倒计时记下生日、纪念日和重要日子，每年重复的会自动数下一次，生日当天还有专属祝福和月历标记。':
      'Beyond schedules, ChengNuo ships with companion features: raise a little penguin that checks in with you and dress it up with points in the decor shop; browse AI-recommended shop cards on the Discover page and add them to your schedule in one tap; track birthdays, anniversaries and big days with Countdowns — yearly ones automatically count down to the next — and enjoy a special blessing with a calendar badge on your birthday.',
    '程诺还提供天气和锁屏卡片。锁屏卡片不解锁就能完成、延时或取消日程。明信片、周报等长期数据优先保存在本机，服务器只做短期中转，注重隐私。界面支持中英文切换，部分基础功能可离线应答。':
      'ChengNuo also offers weather and lock-screen cards — complete, postpone or cancel a schedule right from the lock screen. Long-term data such as postcards and weekly reports stays on your device first; the server only relays briefly — privacy by design. The UI supports Chinese and English, and some basic features answer offline.',
    '程诺是鸿蒙应用大赛参赛作品，最终将以 Apache-2.0 许可证开源。':
      'ChengNuo is an entry for the HarmonyOS App Contest and will eventually be open-sourced under the Apache-2.0 license.',
    'Mygo企鹅研究中心（由复旦大学 2025 级软件工程专业三名学生组成的兴趣团队）关注校园效率工具、HarmonyOS 应用开发和智能体应用。我们发起「程诺」，是因为我们相信校园日程不该只是课表。作业、考试、社团、实习和临时安排，都值得被更好地规划。我们希望「程诺」成为一款开源、尊重用户数据的日程规划应用，让安排日程更简单、更智能。':
      'Mygo Penguin Research Center — a hobby team of three software engineering students from Fudan University (Class of 2025) — focuses on campus productivity tools, HarmonyOS app development and AI-agent applications. We started ChengNuo because we believe campus schedules should be more than a timetable: homework, exams, clubs, internships and last-minute plans all deserve better planning. We hope ChengNuo becomes an open-source schedule planner that respects your data, making planning simpler and smarter.',
